 "segments": [
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Nagiyev and Viktor have a heated argument in the office about the restaurant's budget. Nagiyev wants to save money by firing the most expensive kitchen staff.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Я должен уволить твоих поваров.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ты совсем сошёл с ума?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Они слишком дорого стоят.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Это почти полмиллиона каждый месяц.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ты не можешь их увольнять.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Это лучшая команда в Москве.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Дешевле найти новых людей.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Какая разница, кто режет морковь?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Это моя команда!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Если ты их уволишь, ты потеряешь меня.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Витя, просто сядь и успокойся.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Хорошо, разбирайтесь сами.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "А я пока увольняюсь.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Подожди, мы всё решим.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let us break down this interaction.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Я должен уволить твоих поваров.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I must fire your cooks.' -- ENG The restaurant owner wants to reduce costs.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ты совсем сошёл с ума?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Have you gone completely crazy?' -- ENG The chef is shocked by this sudden decision.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Они слишком дорого стоят.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'They cost too much.' -- ENG Nagiyev explains that the current salaries are too high.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Это почти полмиллиона каждый месяц.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'This is almost half a million every month.' -- ENG He calculates the massive expenses.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ты не можешь их увольнять.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You cannot fire them.' -- ENG Viktor defends his talented colleagues.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Это лучшая команда в Москве.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'This is the best team in Moscow.' -- ENG He insists that their skills are unmatched.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Дешевле найти новых людей.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'It is cheaper to find new people.' -- ENG The owner prefers to hire less experienced workers.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Какая разница, кто режет морковь?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What difference does it make who cuts carrots?' -- ENG He argues that basic tasks do not require experts.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Это моя команда!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'This is my team!' -- ENG The loyal chef refuses to abandon his kitchen staff.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Если ты их уволишь, ты потеряешь меня.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'If you fire them, you will lose me.' -- ENG Viktor gives him a strict ultimatum.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Витя, просто сядь и успокойся.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Vitya, just sit and calm down.' -- ENG Nagiyev tries to de-escalate the conflict.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Хорошо, разбирайтесь сами.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Alright, sort it out yourselves.' -- ENG The angry chef gives up on the conversation.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "А я пока увольняюсь.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And I am quitting in the meantime.' -- ENG He decides to leave his job immediately.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Подожди, мы всё решим.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Wait, we will solve everything.' -- ENG The owner tries to stop him from leaving. Now let us listen to the conversation again without interruption.",
